meta {
  name: Reset Password
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/v1/auth/reset-password
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "token": "paste-reset-token-here",
    "new_password": "N3wS3cur3P@ssw0rd!"
  }
}

docs {
  The token identifies the user, so no user id and no authentication are required — the
  recipient of a reset email is by definition not signed in.

  The token arrives by email. In local dev, read it from the `outbox_worker` container logs,
  or open the link the email contains: `GET /v1/auth/reset-password?token=…` renders a form
  that posts here.

  Setting a new password revokes every session.
}
